>>> testCase "Recursive function with optional argument"
>>> setupFile ~/targetPackage/main.petrol
PREP_FUNC @sumList {
    [ARGS [@myList, @index = (0)]]
    IF (GREATER_EQUAL(index, LEN(myList))) {
        RET (0)
    }
    RET (ADD(MEMBER(myList, index), sumList(myList, ADD(index, 1))))
}
PRINT(sumList(LIST (1, 2, 3, 4)))
>>> expectPrint
10
=========================
